00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:15.760
All right.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.310
We'll do something.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.510
Oh, the train's coming.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:22.910
Okay, my break's going to end.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:24.700
Talk to you later, bye.

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:39.930
Yuno, Hiro, Miyako, Sae...

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:42.890
