00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.380
Is udon or soba okay?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:01.020
I don't really feel like eating noodles.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.520
There's no wind and it's not that cold.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.830
So, it was a packed lunch!

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:18.590
And inside...

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.430
Wow!

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:22.870
Amazing!
This looks delicious!

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:24.430
Did you make this for us?

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:27.610
Unfortunately, I couldn't give it to Chika.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.410
Thank you very much.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.050
Thanks for the food.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.720
Thank you.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:38.460
You didn't know how things
would turn out, so why?

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:39.820
I believed in her.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.820
I guess I'll dig in.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.300
It's delicious!

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.730
I have some hot tea too. Have some.

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:51.030
Okay.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:57.010
This feels great.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:59.200
Yeah, it's pleasant.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.680
It's from Chika.

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.750
She took a commemorative photo.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:12.360
Double peace signs!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.350
I'm really glad.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.750
Excuse me, I'm going to send a response.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:21.230
Say, will Chika come over again?

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:25.060
That's right, exams are already over.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.340
Next time, she should stay over for a week.

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:31.070
Don't tell that to Chika.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:33.040
She'll immediately take it seriously.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.510
I am serious.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:35.980
I did it!

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:36.180
Send
I did it!

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:37.480
Send

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:38.950
Your Message Has Been Sent

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:42.280
You all sure became friends
with Chika quickly.

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:44.820
That's because Chika is a nice girl.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:47.020
She's cheery and cute.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.920
She's just noisy.

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.020
Is it Chika again?

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:57.730
Yeah, she said that she'd like
some sekihan too.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:00.540
Perhaps I should text her as well.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.770
I'm going to tell her that I'll make
some for her at any time

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:04.600
and that she should come over again.

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:06.740
Then, I'll text her too.

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:09.180
Do you know how?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:10.910
I don't.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:11.780
How to I type "mi"?

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:13.150
You push this twice.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:14.920
Do I press this for "ya"?

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:15.890
Yeah...

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.490
"Ko..." "Ko..." "Ko..."

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.790
Push that five times.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.620
Aren't you cold? Are you all right?

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.120
I'm fine.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:31.030
I saw you, Sae.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:32.500
Natsume!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:36.870
You went out to the roof even though
it's the middle of winter.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.170
What were you doing on the roof?

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.070
I was just eating lunch.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:44.350
Huh?

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:46.750
The weather was nice. It felt good.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.680
Did you have lunch in the cafeteria?

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:52.650
Th-Th-That's right!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.150
Do you think she's going to
commute from home?

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.130
It only takes about an hour.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:04.760
I see, Chika's not going to
be living on her own.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:06.970
She said that she wanted to though.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:11.430
But it's really hard to live on your own.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:14.700
Yeah, I didn't know a lot of things at first.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.510
But you all taught me a lot.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:18.350
Hi
But you all taught me a lot.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:19.180
Da

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:20.020
ma

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:20.810
ri

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:27.920
Things have passed by so quickly.
It's almost been a year.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:37.800
Oh yeah, you moved in before me, didn't you?

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:40.260
You just barely made it.

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:45.740
On the day that I moved in, we drew
rabbits with Hiro, didn't we?

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:48.430
Oh, that's still in my room.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:50.310
Really?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.680
If I'm not mistaken...

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.850
Miya-chan?

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.190
Why are you wearing your school uniform?

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:08.430
I can't find it unless I clean up.

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.230
How nostalgic.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.630
Is this yours, Miyako?

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:23.600
Looking at it now, it wasn't very good.

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.740
Sorry, I'm not sure what to make of it.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:28.010
This is kind of embarrassing.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:29.870
This is mine.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.650
I think it's cute.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.720
It's childish.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:36.280
Why didn't I draw anything?

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.850
You had a deadline that day.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.250
Oh...

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:43.030
By the way, Hiro, what kind of
snacks do you have today?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:48.020
Honestly, Miya-chan, it's not as if
I have something all the time.

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:52.430
But there's a high possibility
you'll have something.

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.830
That's true.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.240
Let me see...

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.580
Plop...

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:07.240
What's wrong?

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:11.150
Oh, this?

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.990
Throw it away! Throw it away!

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:15.610
It's gotten all soft.

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.090
Soft?

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:18.860
I'm talking about the tangerine!

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.820
Are you all right?

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:22.060
Yeah!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.630
Here you go.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:25.790
Eat this.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:28.070
Beans?

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.400
Yeah, these are the ones we didn't throw.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:34.370
I see, perhaps I'll eat the same
number as my age again.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:36.880
Miyako, did you wash your hands?

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.810
You were cleaning up, weren't you?

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:42.450
My hands are clean and my room is clean.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:46.050
Her school uniform is still dirty though.

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:47.860
What?

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:50.120
That school uniform is from middle school.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:53.530
I always wear it when I clean.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:57.390
Oh yeah, you were wearing it on
the art department's cleaning day.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:00.070
Yeah, I've been doing it ever since then.

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:03.510
I was told to wear clothes
I don't mind getting dirty.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.040
So, you wore your school uniform?

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.040
Didn't you have anything else?

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.780
Like an old apron?

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:10.840
Or white robes?

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:18.960
Hello?

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.320
Big sis!

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.420
What is it? Did something happen?

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:29.290
I was in a rush earlier, so I'd like to tell
you once again that I got accepted.

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:31.360
Yeah, that's right.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:33.270
Where's my congratulations?

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:36.810
Huh? I already did that.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.410
Say it again.

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.970
I don't want to. Don't make me say it again.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.770
Why not? It's not a big deal.

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:46.180
Is that all you want to talk to me about?

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:47.580
In that case, I'm hanging up.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:48.380
Big sis...

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.480
Big sis...
Big sis...

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:51.580
You've gotten cold again!

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.390
Huh? That's not true.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.320
Health Room

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:02.800
Say, Mrs. Kuwahara, who are you
going to give a chocolate to?

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:08.770
