depressed if you don't give him one.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.810
I won't give him one.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:15.110
I have no chocolates to give to him.

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:19.440
Still, do you have anyone else
to give chocolates to?

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:24.350
Why don't you give one to the principal?

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:25.880
Okay.

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.420
Yahoo!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:34.760
It's cold.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:37.870
We should have gone shopping a little earlier.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.430
Well, we only thought of doing it just now.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.270
Hey, Yunocchi!

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:48.040
Chika says that she's
having gyoza for dinner.

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:50.650
That's because it's Chika's favorite.

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:52.200
Is this one serving?

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:54.050
It looks like one year's worth.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.350
She looks like her stomach
is going to explode.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:01.690
Hey!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:02.820
Landlady!

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:06.130
Going out together?
You sure are good friends.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.620
What do you want?

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:10.030
Well...

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:13.200
Could you take these?

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:15.600
I haven't been able to pass all of them out.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.000
Huh?

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:21.470
I've already got that flier.
Three of the same one.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.680
I've got them too.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.850
You don't mind getting five more, do you?

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:29.840
I don't need them.
Don't stuff them in my mailbox.

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.780
You still have a lot.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.420
Are you passing them all out by yourself?

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:38.660
It's pretty cold. That's hard work.

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:40.090
You understand?

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:42.190
Could you take ten of them?

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:43.490
No way.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:50.610
Cold!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.470
It's freezing, isn't it?

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.500
Let's go under the kotatsu.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:58.780
Yeah! I'm going to put the meat
and the tofu in the fridge.

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.710
You can leave it there.

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:15.100
Warm...

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:19.130
We should get started.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:21.000
Yeah...

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:23.370
Warm...

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.230
Let's put some spirit into it.

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.770
Miya-chan, cut the onions!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.380
Roger that!

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.120
Umm...

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:34.650
I'm going to cut them!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.520
Miya-chan, that's dangerous!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:41.550
When you use a knife, you make your
left hand into a cat's paw.

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:43.190
A cat's paw?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:46.730
Meow!

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:47.720
Scary!
Meow!

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:51.690
Yuno, what should I do?

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.300
Umm, could you tie together the shirataki?

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.370
Shirataki
Umm, could you tie together the shirataki?

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:56.740
Shirataki

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:21.800
All right, I'm bringing something hot.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.060
I've been waiting for it!

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:25.070
Is it all right if I place it here?

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:26.590
Maybe a little more to the right.

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.600
I'm hungry.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:29.730
All right.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.010
Huh?

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:34.670
Why isn't it going on?

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:36.480
Is it out of gas?

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:37.770
Oh no!

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.650
So, this is what a half-dead snake looks like.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:42.810
Miya-chan!

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:47.920
It looks about ready.

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:49.690
It looks delicious!

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:51.760
Huh? Where's the tofu?

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:52.560
Oh!

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:54.520
Sorry!

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:58.290
I'll cut some here.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.990
Tofu is the true star of a hot pot after all.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:04.000
Once you put that in, it will truly be complete.

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:06.770
It's the finishing touch, Miss Yuno!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.120
H-Here I go!

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:16.080
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:18.590
Clap!

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:20.080
Bon appétit!

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:21.810
Bon appétit!

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:29.920
What kind of hot pot would this be?

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:33.570
Well, it's not a mizutaki.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.140
I guess it's a yosenabe.

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:39.900
No, this hot pot is one of those, right, Hiro?

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:41.140
Huh?

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:42.810
A chankonabe?

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:44.010
Chanko

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:54.020
Hiro, your homemade tsumire is delicious!

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:55.790
I want more rice!

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:58.190
You've got quite the appetite.

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:03.890
Here, I'm going to make some rice porridge
as well, so don't eat all the rice.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.500
Okay! Gotchan desu.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:05.870
Gotchan desu
Okay! Gotchan desu.

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:06.960
Gotchan desu

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.470
Let's begin round two.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:11.970
Do we have enough soup?

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.640
It's all right. We still have quite
a bit of nokotta nokotta.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:16.110
Nokotta Nokotta

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:29.950
When I eat hot things, my glasses fog up.

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:31.790
Are you going to take them off?

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:37.600
This is probably the first time I've
seen you without glasses, Sae.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.500
My eyes are pretty bad.

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:44.470
Huh? Why's this so heavy?

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:48.370
Put on your glasses!

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:52.900
That was delicious!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.510
I'm stuffed.

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:57.180
This is bliss!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:04.090
Hiro, we'll clean up. Just leave that there.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:06.700
Huh? I'm not cleaning up.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.820
We still have dessert!

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:10.790
Dessert?

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.530
The best thing to finish up a
hot pot is hot pot shiruko.

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.060
It smells sweet!

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:29.010
I'm going to take a bath and go to sleep.

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:45.570
I texted Chika a lot today.

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.330
I want to see her again.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:51.670
I'd like to congratulate her in person.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:00.480
I can't sleep. I'm still excited.

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:09.960
February 6 The End
To Be Continued

