00:23:40.030 --> 00:23:41.000
Preview

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:43.000
Preview
Yuno, are you all right?
Do you have muscle pains?

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:46.270
Preview
Typical Yunocchi. Coming the next
day proves that she's young.

00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:48.140
Preview
Miya-chan, you're the same age as me.

00:23:48.140 --> 00:23:50.410
Preview
If your exercises are rough, you should
do them for short amounts of time.

00:23:50.410 --> 00:23:53.440
Preview
And if they're easy, you should
take your time with them.

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:55.280
Preview
I don't think it has anything to do with age.

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:57.150
Preview
Why do you have muscle pains, Hiro?

00:23:57.150 --> 00:23:59.280
Preview
She was doing sumo squats all night!

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:00.450
Preview
No, I wasn't!

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:00.950
Preview

00:24:00.950 --> 00:24:04.820
Preview
The next episode is
"May 27, Guardian Monster"

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:06.260
Preview
We'll be waiting at Hidamari Apartments.

00:24:06.260 --> 00:24:07.990
Preview
Be sure to tune in!

